#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:3 10b5b1c7c90b4c36af2a0d8f63ac5904
msgid "Offline Tools"
msgstr "离线工具"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:5 52e1c890252a4089993b986a0dd5faaf
msgid ""
"There are a couple of offline tools within the MAVLink package that can be "
"used for a postflight analysis."
msgstr "MAVLink 软件包中有几款离线工具可用于飞后分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:11 f42814026dcd4542bfaa5c19da6ffc6b
msgid "mavgraph.py"
msgstr "mavgraph.py"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:13 a2cbffa8318e4832b66f4ec13f5a374d
msgid "This can graph any of the flight data."
msgstr "可绘制任意飞行数据的图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:19 5d08463ae8af420081eaec5adc223d71
msgid ""
"Other than specifying the tlog file, the commands are exactly the same as "
"the :ref:`graph <mavproxy-modulegraph>` module in MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"除指定 tlog 文件外，其命令与 MAVProxy 中 :ref:`graph <mavproxy-modulegraph>` 模块的命令完全相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:23 736bf65b9175429a8829ec76463bc24a
msgid "mavtogpx.py"
msgstr "mavtogpx.py"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:25 d6d5ea5c11be4ce6a0d1bde12dad71ed
msgid ""
"Exports the GPS points in a logfile to the GPX format, which can be read by "
"Google Earth."
msgstr "将日志文件中的 GPS 点导出为 GPX 格式，可由 Google Earth 读取。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:33 44450a7db2514fceaabdce5e8f9d164f
msgid "mavparms.py"
msgstr "mavparms.py"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:35 afc3103de5ea4d4fa8c9a5ad7a674909
msgid ""
"Finds the ArduPilot parameters in a logfile and displays them on the "
"console."
msgstr "在日志文件中查找 ArduPilot 参数并将其显示在控制台上。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:42 d53c0eb0bfad4a43b67885999e7a5d71
msgid "mavflighttime.py"
msgstr "mavflighttime.py"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:44 ec170b427fca41a68d0a753d300ffd81
msgid ""
"Prints out the total time spent in the air. Note that a threshold of 3m/s "
"defines the difference between air time and ground time. This can be changed"
" by the ``--groundspeed=`` argument."
msgstr "输出总飞行时间。请注意，以 3m/s 为阈值来区分空中时间和地面时间，此阈值可通过 ``--groundspeed=`` 参数更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:53 2b1fb103f56c425483a7b7deeeb2d157
msgid "mavflightmodes.py"
msgstr "mavflightmodes.py"

#: ../../source/docs/analysis/mavtools.rst:55 8ae54cc336fa48bf95e0e5e5de1b4c99
msgid ""
"Prints out the timestamp and name of each flight mode change in a logfile."
msgstr "输出日志文件中每次飞行模式切换的时间戳和名称。"
